// std: the cadetta standard library, package root (stdlib.md 1).
//
// Written in ordinary .cdt. Every module is a file under this directory
// (packages.md 2), added by its own story: fits, materials, fasteners,
// retaining, commercial. Per-standard `pub cite` exports (iso273, iso286,
// din471, din472, ...) live at this root once the syntax and the
// standards' figures land. Nothing is declared here yet on purpose: no
// value may appear in std without a citation (S001).
